eriments/solution.py would be:\n\ndef remove_even(s):\n    return \'\'.join(char for idx, char in enumerate(s) if idx % 2 != 0)\n\nWait, but using a generator expression instead of a list comprehension. Either way works. Both are acceptable. The join method will handle it.\n\nYes, that should do it.\n</think>\n\n<answer>\ndef remove_even(s):\n    return \'\'.join(char for idx, char in enumerate(s) if idx % 2 != 0)\n</answer>'
